"Keldenar is a reincarnated soul from another world, and he spoke with the gods before rebirth."
"Keldenar's Eyes of Truth was the gift he chose at reincarnation."
"Keldenar wanted a dimensional affinity at rebirth but lacked the points, so he took Golemancer."
"The gods told Keldenar reincarnated souls may be reborn only as humans, elves or dwarves."
"An elf rebirth cost an outrageous price and would not suit the Golemancer class."
"Keldenar seeks great deeds to buy a new race, perhaps a golem one, for his next life."
"Keldenar taught Syl how the gods harvest mortals' deeds and how a soul keeps its memories."
"Keldenar's Eyes of Truth exposed Syl as a slime; he then swore his oath to keep her secret."
"Keldenar likely bears an Emblem marking him as from another world; the world censors asking."
"Keldenar knows Vee too is a soul reborn from his old world."
